        <briefdescription>
<para>Extracts the file name from a path. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Forwards to <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-utility-functions_1ga791f22f0c85b6436c9016821907b0653" kindref="member">utility::extract_file_name()</ref></computeroutput>, which the framework uses internally; it is kept only for compatibility with the existing applications.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The path, as a C-string. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>A pointer to the file name within the input string, after the last <computeroutput>/</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>\\endiskip</computeroutput> separator, or the string itself if there is no separator.</para>
</simplesect>
<xrefsect id="deprecated_1_deprecated000080"><xreftitle>Deprecated</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Use <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-utility-functions_1ga791f22f0c85b6436c9016821907b0653" kindref="member">utility::extract_file_name()</ref></computeroutput> (since 5.1.0). </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect><xrefsect id="deprecated_1_deprecated000081"><xreftitle>Deprecated</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>use <ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-utility-functions_1ga791f22f0c85b6436c9016821907b0653" kindref="member">utility::extract_file_name()</ref></para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
<para>Delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-utility-functions_1ga791f22f0c85b6436c9016821907b0653" kindref="member">utility::extract_file_name()</ref></computeroutput>, the single implementation used by the framework, so both the <computeroutput>/</computeroutput> and the <computeroutput>\\endiskip</computeroutput> separators are recognised. If no separator is present, the original input string is returned.</para>
<para><xrefsect id="deprecated_1_deprecated000131"><xreftitle>Deprecated</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Use <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-utility-functions_1ga791f22f0c85b6436c9016821907b0653" kindref="member">utility::extract_file_name()</ref></computeroutput> (since 5.1.0). </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
