    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ source file with implementations for the µTest++ reflection utilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the implementation of the deprecated <computeroutput>reflection::short_name()</computeroutput>, which extracts the base file name from a fully qualified path, by delegating to <computeroutput>utility::extract_file_name()</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1reflection" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::reflection</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
